{"title":"R语言操作","uid":"105dbb909226a529a9f923ca0d711350","slug":"R","date":"2025-06-07T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2025-12-03T18:35:29.749Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/R.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/images/cover/R.webp","content":"<div class=\"custom-quote danger\">\n<span class=\"custom-quote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M19.76 5.23C15.84 5.23 12 2 12 2C12 2 8.15996 5.23 4.23996 5.23C4.23996 5.23 1.86996 16.99 12 22C22.13 16.99 19.76 5.23 19.76 5.23Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M12 8V13\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M11.99 16H12\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"custom-quote-title\">注意</p>\n<p>本文为编者自用，所使用的软件为<strong>RStudio</strong>，设备系统为<strong>macOS Public 非 Beta 最高配置</strong>。<br>Mac系统和Windows系统的键盘符号对应如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Mac</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Win</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌘</code> (<code>command</code>, <code>cmd</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>ctrl</code> (control)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌥</code> (<code>option</code>, <code>opt</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>alt</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⌃</code> (<code>control</code>, <code>ctrl</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\">无对应键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⇧</code> (<code>shift</code>)</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code>⇧</code> (<code>shift</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n<h1 id=\"快捷键\"><a href=\"#快捷键\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"快捷键\"></a>快捷键</h1><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">内容</th>\n<th align=\"left\">快捷键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">添加代码块（.rmd）</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>cmd</code> + <code>opt</code> + <code>i</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">赋值（<code>&lt;-</code>）</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>opt</code> + <code>-</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">管道（<code>%&gt;%</code>）（需使用<code>tidyverse</code>包）</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>cmd</code> + <code>shift</code> + <code>m</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","feature":false,"text":"编者自用的R语言操作技巧...","permalink":"/post/R","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":316,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"R","slug":"R","count":1,"path":"api/categories/R.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Self-use","slug":"Self-use","count":3,"path":"api/tags/Self-use.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E9%94%AE\"><span class=\"toc-text\">快捷键</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"王观旭","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.png","link":"https://guanxuwang.github.io","description":"<p>真理所在之处，数学生生不息。</p>The learning materials throughout my life.","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/guanxuwang","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"https://www.zhihu.com/people/wang-guan-xu-96","csdn":"https://blog.csdn.net/GuanxuWANG","juejin":"","customs":{"bilibili":{"icon":"/svg/bilibili.svg","link":"https://space.bilibili.com/23972352"},"mail":{"icon":"/svg/mail.svg","link":"mailto:wanggx11174@163.com"},"wechat-pay":{"icon":"/svg/wechat-pay.svg","link":"/svg/wechat-pay.JPG"}}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"LaTeX操作","uid":"0b720979fc7391d027a05e038a05d97d","slug":"LaTeX","date":"2025-06-07T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2025-12-03T18:35:05.282Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/LaTeX.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/images/cover/LaTeX.webp","text":"编者自用的LaTeX操作技巧...","permalink":"/post/LaTeX","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"4k","symbolsTime":"4 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"LaTeX","slug":"LaTeX","count":1,"path":"api/